                <pb facs="0535" n="501" xml:id="pg501"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Sherman to Mr. Woodford.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-12-06"><hi rendition="#italic">December 6,
                        1897</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Is it not possible to hasten expediente Salomon tobacco case?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sherman.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
